  "title": "\"GTP: Add option to decode T-PDU Data with a plugin dissector\"",
  "description": "As of now GTP dissector provides option to decode T-PDU data ether, async, and with some heuristics.\n![before](/uploads/2fad2fc255c24b6bc629320b9b24c826/before.png)\n\nBut there is no option present to decode T-PDU as new protocol with a plugin.\n\nThis change adds an option to decode T-PDU data with a plugin, to help develop and test new protocols that are\nencapsulated as GTP T-PDU data.\nThis is how the new option looks like.\n![newOption](/uploads/210a7293df55d813b570f65b6002efc2/newOption.png)\n\nFollowing is screenshot of T-PDU data decoded with a demo LUA plugin.\n![withcustom](/uploads/12e27933d047b8520174457f362ebd81/withcustom.png)",
